{"id":"n60236-1-8","stage":1,"title":"그동안 · 这段时间","scene":"久别问候","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60236-1-8-1","ko":"선배님, 그동안 안녕하셨어요?","zh":"前辈，这段时间您过得好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선배님,","meaning":"前辈","explanation":"선배：同一领域或组织中资历较早的人；-님 增加尊敬语气。","readings":[{"term":"선배","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66306","senseId":"1","lemma":"선배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선배님","audio":"/audio/3843029717aaaefa7507.mp3"}},{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间。","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}},{"text":"안녕하셨어요?","meaning":"安好","explanation":"안녕하다：安好；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"안녕하다","audio":"/audio/e9da00d63b62272d4074.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72523","senseId":"2","lemma":"안녕하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안녕하셨어요","audio":"/audio/0a10024295865f16c9ce.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5a64f841df328061","term":"선배","zh":"前辈","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3","entryId":"66306","definition":"同一领域、学校或组织中资历比自己早的人。","pronunciation":["선배"]},{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"e9da00d63b62272d","term":"안녕하다","zh":"安好","audio":"/audio/e9da00d63b62272d4074.mp3","entryId":"72523","definition":"身体健康，内心平稳。","pronunciation":["안녕하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/90106fb2a3bb85c249ed.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60236-1-8-2","ko":"그럼. 정말 오랜만이구나. 너도 잘 지냈니?","zh":"是啊，真的好久不见了。你也过得好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼.","meaning":"是啊、当然","explanation":"그럼：肯定回答前一句问候，相当于“当然、是啊”。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"오랜만이구나.","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만이구나","audio":"/audio/15da57521578eafba0ae.mp3"}},{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너도","audio":"/audio/31b5ecd28525b86681fe.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"지냈니?","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지냈니","audio":"/audio/9e2928b8baccae422a4d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"是啊、当然","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"62277","definition":"对前面的问题作肯定回答。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"